  "status": "Approved",
  "description": "Rear extensions, with partial demolition and extension of the existing rear outrigger and the construction of an infill extension to create a larger kitchen and living/dining area, that open onto a new terrace at the rear of the flat. Relocation of the front door to the flat with the installation of a new external door with a new roof canopy over, alterations to the fenestration at lower ground floor level with the removal of one side window, the enlargement of another side window  and the installation of two new side windows, and the installation of a replacement side gate giving access to the flat's side access passageway. General refurbishment of the entire flat with internal and external alterations with new structure where required and new services installations. ",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall begin not later than three years from the date of this decision.\r\nReason: In order to comply with Section 91 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990, as amended by Section 51 of the Planning and Compulsory Purchase Act 2004.",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and specifications: [Design and access statement, PM03, PM02 Rev A, PM01 Rev A, PM04, F01 Rev A, Unnumbered location plan, PL03 Rev B, PL02 Rev B, PL01 Rev B received 31/03/2026].\r\nReason: In order to ensure the development is carried out in accordance with the planning permission.",
    "Condition : 3 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the development hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building, unless otherwise shown on the approved plans.\r\nReason: In order to safeguard the appearance of the area."
